lated to this level.   Understands key information in written texts about the communicative topics related to this level."}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Descriptive writing"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "A descriptive paragraph describes a thing, a person, or a place.<br/> Detailed information lets the reader make an image in his or her mind. <br/>There are three parts to a paragraph."}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":3,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" Topic Sentence:\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Introduces the main idea/point that you want to develop\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" Supporting Sentences:\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" To add to and provide examples of the main point \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" Concluding Sentence:\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" Finishes off the paragraph\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border\"}"}, {"type": "text", "content": "You use adjectives and adverbs to add detail and description in your writing. This allows the reader to imagine what you are writing about."}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "run-down"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "not cared for, old, too much use"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: The painting shows an old, run down shack in Columbus, Ohio. "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn2le09ob08aud01"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": " These are words you use when you talk about artwork."}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "shack"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "an old damaged house"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: The run down shack was abandoned."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn2le09ob08aud02"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "broken"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "damaged"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: The farmhouse has broken windows and no door. "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn2le09ob08aud03"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "drought"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a long time without rain"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: The family left the farm after a drought in 1930."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn2le09ob08aud04"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "abandoned"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "empty"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: It is abandoned."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn2le09ob08aud05"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "plaque"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a square with a description of a painting"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Did you see the plaque under the painting?"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn2le09ob08aud06"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "powerful"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "strong, important"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Nicholson's painting is a powerful picture of these times."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn2le09ob08aud07"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "porch"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "part of the front of a house you can stand on"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: There is no porch on the front of th